:''For the enemy encountered in the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]], see [[Super Devil (Enemy)]].''
'''Super Devil''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 9.7 Update|Version 9.7]] increases his health, movement speed and knockback count. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 13.6 Update#Version 13.6.1|Version 13.6.1]].

