==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Imposter Super Devil''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Super D-Devil''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
Super Devil works very well against [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]]s, as it outranges most of them and [[Slow|Slows]] them down. His Slow has good uptime and duration, making him dominate most Angel stages by himself.

Super Devil's low movement speed may sometimes hinder it from giving proper support in time, as it cannot keep up with the frontlines, but this issue can be solved by luring the enemies to your base.

==='''True Form'''===
With more speed, health and knockbacks, Super D-Devil can keep up with the frontlines and provide support in time. High knockback count is a really great asset for a [[Long Distance]] unit like Super D-Devil as now he will have more chances to reposition himself when an enemy enters his blindspot. Overall, it increases Super Devil's survivability, which is very important for something with the long distance ability.

==='''Talents'''===
'''Target [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]]''' is actually a decent Talent if you lack decent anti-Relic supports. Super D-Devil already outranges a vast majority of Relic targets, so he can serve as good crowd-control in early [[Uncanny Legends]] against [[M. Ost]] or [[Relic Bun-Bun]]. He is inevitably overshadowed when you start to get better anti-Relic controllers, though.

On the other hand, '''[[Immune to Curse|Curse Immunity]]''' is borderline unnecessary. The best remedy to getting Cursed is to simply not get hit at all, and given he's a super-backliner, he won't have much trouble accomplishing that much, with or without this Talent. It's really only useful against [[Loris]].

'''[[Weaken]]''' is very expensive for what it achieves, and doesn't see many returns. It only has a 50% activation rate, and barely retains a 50% uptime at max level; this doesn't even cover the full duration of his Slow. It's a decent secondary layer of defense, but that's as far as it goes in most circumstances.

'''Attack Buff''' and '''HP Buff''' are not needed. Super D-Devil is a crowd-controller and his personal damage is already on the lower side regardless. If you wish to improve them, use [[Catseye]]s.

